nts who are `going` or `maybe` see one another by display name; or `hidden`, in which no registrant sees another. Fixed at publish (VTI-EVT-051). A VTA offers no `anonymous` (VTI-PEV-002).","type":"string","enum":["visible","hidden"]},"EventInstant":{"title":"EventInstant","type":"string","format":"date-time","description":"An RFC 3339 instant in UTC, whole seconds, such as `2026-11-30T18:30:00Z`."},"RegistrationSettings":{"title":"RegistrationSettings","description":"How the event takes registrations (VTI-EVT-031 – 036).","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["mode"],"properties":{"mode":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/RegistrationMode"},"capacity":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":100000,"description":"The most people who may be going, plus-ones included. Absent means no limit."},"waitlist":{"type":"boolean","description":"Registrations beyond `capacity` are waitlisted, and the first on the waitlist becomes going when a place frees (VTI-EVT-033). Absent means false: a registration beyond capacity is refused."},"plusOnes":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":10,"description":"The most guests a registrant may bring. Absent means 0."},"opensAt":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/EventInstant","description":"Registrations are refused before this. Absent means from publication."},"closesAt":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/EventInstant","description":"Registrations and changes are refused after this, except withdrawal (VTI-EVT-037). Absent means at the event\'s start."},"questions":{"type":"array","maxItems":20,"items":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/RegistrationQuestion"}},"codeOfConduct":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/CodeOfConduct"}}},"CodeOfConduct":{"title":"CodeOfConduct","description":"A code of conduct a registrant acknowledges before the registration is accepted (VTI-EVT-035). `sha256` pins the text acknowledged.","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["url","sha256"],"properties":{"url":{"type":"string","format":"uri","maxLength":2048,"pattern":"^https://"},"sha256":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}\$"}}},"RegistrationQuestion":{"title":"RegistrationQuestion","description":"A question a registrant answers when registering. Answers are read by the event\'s hosts only, and are deleted on the event\'s retention schedule (VTI-EVT-034, VTI-EVT-090).","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["questionId","label","kind"],"properties":{"questionId":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/RegistrationQuestionId"},"label":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200,"description":"The question as shown. Plain text."},"kind":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/RegistrationQuestionKind"},"choices":{"type":"array","minItems":2,"maxItems":20,"uniqueItems":true,"items":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":100},"description":"Present exactly when `kind` is `choice`."},"required":{"type":"boolean","description":"The registration is refused without an answer. Absent means false."}}},"RegistrationQuestionKind":{"title":"RegistrationQuestionKind","type":"string","enum":["text","choice","boolean"],"description":"`text`: a free answer of at most 500 characters. `choice`: one of `choices`. `boolean`: yes or no."},"RegistrationQuestionId":{"title":"RegistrationQuestionId","type":"string","pattern":"^[a-z][a-z0-9-]{0,31}\$","description":"A question\'s key within its event."},"RegistrationMode":{"title":"RegistrationMode","description":"`open`: a member of the audience who registers is going at once (or waitlisted when full). `approval`: a registration is pending until a host decides it. `closed`: no registrations; the event is for information only (VTI-EVT-031).","type":"string","enum":["open","approval","closed"]},"AccessDetails":{"title":"AccessDetails","description":"Where the event happens and how to join it (VTI-EVT-060 – 063). Answered by vtc/events/access/show to a registrant who is going, from `revealAt` if set; included in the event itself only where `public` is true.","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"places":{"type":"array","maxItems"